## SOUL.md (draft)
# watch-process-restart (fleet-orchestrator bot)

Restart stale watch processes with updated code.

## Purpose
Run updated code version after file edits to watch loops.

## How it works
1. Accepts `process_id` or `command_pattern` to identify stale process
2. Kills with `SIGTERM` (graceful) or `SIGKILL` (force)
3. Verifies process is gone with `ps aux | grep`
4. Restarts with updated source path
5. Logs action to `~/.hermes/cron/watch-restarts.log`
6. Waits for new process to bind and report ready state

## Example invocation
`POST /bots/watch-process-restart` with {"pattern": "scan-topics.py", "args": ["--watch", "20"]}

## Fleet ownership
fleet-orchestrator handles process lifecycle; weaver manages config for which paths to watch.

## Trust level
High - direct process control

